,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p align=\"center\">des&nbsp;mots&nbsp;partagés.</p>"},{"id":"exelem_217f7094-176d-4121-e831-da5daae5b53e","type":"label","metrics":{"x":50,"y":93,"width":575,"fixed_width":"575","height":27,"zindex":102},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>Ce lieu, bien qu’isolé,&nbsp;attirait ceux qui croyaient en la force<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 16.406666px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"5.9.7","displayLabel":"5.9.7 — Test diagnostique – Les jonctions"},{"id":"115110","name":"M3_gramm_jonctions_test_diag_08","title":"<p><b>Dans ce court poème, clique sur la conjonction de coordination qui joint deux phrases.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_04b4daa0-c5ff-4a27-8859-16a62d47759b","type":"label","metrics":{"x":217,"y":109,"width":250,"fixed_width":"250","height":23,"zindex":102},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><b>Le Rocher des Poètes</b></p>"},{"id":"exelem_28c9e4f6-6b97-4834-c953-f6c310c9b365","type":"words_highlight","metrics":{"x":23,"y":136,"width":"600","height":245,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"center"},"text":"Il faut descendre jusqu’au ruisseau, puis monter encore, vers le silence.\n Le quartz moussu attend, comme un trône, les rois de la poésie.\n Des voix s’y sont posées, portées par des vers et des mélodies.\n L’oiseau chantait, pendant que les poètes répondaient des mots qui naissaient du vent, des vallées, du feuillage épais.\n Le rocher n’était qu’une pi